# Malformed money amounts

Units are written without separators or grouped by three with `,`, and an
amount has one or two decimals after `.`. Each malformed amount below is
reported with the expected form.

```catala
declaration short_groups content money equals $1,2,3
declaration long_first_group content money equals $8548,650.96
declaration group_of_two content money equals $12,34
declaration group_of_four content money equals $1,2345
declaration three_decimals content money equals $12.345
```

